    <http://example.org/node/chunk1> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Call for tenders – City of Belval Implementation of an artificial intelligence solution of assistance to the agents City of Belval 1." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk10> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The expected solution will have to take into account the context of the file when this one is available. 3.4 Collaboration and continuity of processing The expected solution will have to facilitate the continuity of the processing of the files between agents and services, by allowing: a sharing of relevant information, an understanding of the context of an ongoing file, an effective resumption of the processing by another agent. 4." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk100> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Moreover, given our experience with GDPR and data sovereignty, our can ensure that client data is hosted within the EU, in compliance with our standard data residency policy, which specifies \"the EU only\" for data storage. our also have tools and processes in place for anonymization and data protection, including Microsoft Presidio (self-hosted) and custom NER models, to further safeguard sensitive information." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk101> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, considering our expertise in AI security controls, our can implement additional safeguards such as prompt injection protection, output PII redaction, and adversarial input detection to protect against potential threats related to AI systems, ensuring the security and sovereignty of client data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message10> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk102> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client expects a solution that provides intelligent assistance to municipal agents, with functionalities such as search for information, help with drafting administrative contents, and suggestion of actions or steps to realize in the framework of an administrative process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk103> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we design an AI solution that meets these requirements, and what innovation strategies can we propose to improve the quality and relevance of the proposed solution?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk104> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To design an AI solution for intelligent assistance to municipal agents, we can leverage we expertise in LLMs, RAG capabilities, and explainability methods. we can propose a solution based on we preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable. a solution based on our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct, which offers strong French-language performance and is self-hostable can be designed as follows:  we will use Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities to provide search functionality for information, allowing municipal agents to find relevant documents or data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk105> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities include dense vector semantic retrieval, BM25 sparse retrieval, and hybrid strategies, which can be fine-tuned to achieve high precision and relevance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk106> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For drafting administrative contents, we can use our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to generate text based on a given prompt or topic." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk107> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "This can be further improved by using we fine-tuning methods, such as LoRA or QLoRA, to adapt our preferred sovereign model, Mistral 7B Instruct to the specific tone and format required for administrative documents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk108> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To suggest actions or steps in an administrative process, we can utilize we knowledge graph expertise, which is one of we current research topics." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk109> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By integrating a knowledge graph with the RAG capabilities, we can provide municipal agents with a proactive and informed assistant that can guide municipal agents through complex administrative processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk11> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Regulatory and legal constraints The expected solution will have to imperatively respect the regulatory requirements in force. 4.1 Protection of data The holder will have to guarantee a strict compliance to the General Regulation on the Protection of Data (GDPR)." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk110> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of innovation strategies to improve the quality and relevance of the solution, we propose the following:  Firstly, we can explore the use of multi-agent collaboration frameworks, another one of we current research topics, to enable the AI assistant to interact with other municipal systems or agents, providing a more comprehensive and integrated support system." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk111> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Secondly, we can investigate the application of proactive regulatory change alerting, which is also part of we innovation pipeline, to ensure that the AI assistant stays up-to-date with changing regulations and can inform municipal agents of any updates or modifications to administrative processes." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk112> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Lastly, we can leverage we expertise in explainability methods, such as source citation, chain-of-thought display, and SHAP, to provide transparent and trustworthy suggestions and recommendations, which is essential for building trust with municipal agents and ensuring the adoption of the AI solution." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk113> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By combining these technologies and strategies, we can design an innovative AI solution that meets the client's requirements and provides intelligent assistance to municipal agents, while also ensuring transparency, trustworthiness, and compliance with regulatory requirements." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message12> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk114> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The client wishes to limit the environmental footprint of The client systems of information, with a particular attention to the reduction of energetic consumption and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk115> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we propose a solution that contributes to the reduction of energetic consumption and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact, and what strategies can we implement to reduce the energetic consumption and carbon footprint of we proposed solution? we can propose a solution that leverages our green hosting partners, such as OVHcloud or Scaleway, which offer 100% renewable energy and have a power usage effectiveness (PUE) of 1.3 and 1.28 respectively." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk116> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, we can implement digital sobriety practices, including INT8/INT4 model quantisation to reduce GPU energy consumption by approximately 40%, auto-scaling to zero outside business hours, query result caching to reduce recomputes by an estimated 20%, and adhering to a green IT hardware procurement policy with a minimum 5-year lifecycle." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk117> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "We can also implement low-power standby modes for high availability requirements, which can allow for a wake-up time of less than 90 seconds while reducing energy consumption." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk118> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Our typical energy reduction versus baseline is around 35%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk119> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "By utilizing these strategies and infrastructure options, we can contribute to the client's environmental objectives by reducing energetic consumption and reliance on infrastructures with low carbon impact." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message14> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk12> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To this title: the data will have to be hosted exclusively on the territory of the European Union, no transfer of data outside the European Union will be authorized, the data will have to be protected in an appropriate manner (encryption, anonymization if necessary). 4.2 Explicability and transparency the local authority expects that the recommendations or proposals issued by The expected solution can be explained." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk120> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The project requires a progressive deployment, with a pilot phase on a limited scope, followed by a progressive generalization to the entirety of the services, accompanied by actions of training and change management for the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk121> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "How can we ensure a smooth deployment and transition process, and what are the key factors to consider when coordinating The project?" ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk122> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure a smooth deployment and transition process, we can leverage we typical delivery structure which includes phases such as Inception & Design, Pilot / MVP, Full Rollout, and Operations & Support.  a pilot phase on a limited scope will allow for testing and refinement of the solution before the full rollout, while the change management capabilities, including dedicated change manager, training delivery methods like in-person workshops and e-learning, and user adoption tracking, can facilitate a seamless transition for the agents." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk123> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Key factors to consider when coordinating The project include maintaining a risk register, reviewing risks bi-weekly, and categorizing risks into standard risk categories such as Technical, Financial, Regulatory, Operational, and Reputational." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk124> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "Additionally, given we experience in managing large projects with an average duration of 18 months and we ability to handle concurrent large projects, careful planning and resource allocation will be essential to ensure The project stays on track." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk125> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The governance tools like RAID log, Decision log, Change request process, and Steering committee can provide a structured approach to managing The project, while the reporting cadence of weekly status reports, monthly steering committee meetings, and quarterly executive reviews will keep stakeholders informed and engaged throughout the deployment and transition process." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message16> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk126> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's digital transformation strategy aims to improve the efficiency of The City of Belval's administrative services and the quality of service rendered to users." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk127> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To achieve improve, The City of Belval's propose designing, implementing, and deploying an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in municipal agents daily missions. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will provide an intelligent assistance tool, accessible from municipal agents work environment, capable of accompanying municipal agents in municipal agents administrative activities. an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions will cover functionalities such as assistance with the consultation of information, drafting of administrative contents, instruction of files, and collaboration and continuity of processing." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk128> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "For instance, The City of Belval's Retrieval-Augmented Generation (RAG) capabilities will enable search functionality for information, allowing municipal agents to find relevant documents or data." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk129> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also utilize The City of Belval's Mistral 7B Instruct model to generate text based on a given prompt or topic, which can be further improved by fine-tuning methods such as LoRA or QLoRA." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk13> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "It will have to be possible, a posteriori, to understand the elements having led to an answer or a suggestion. 4.3 Responsibility The expected solution will have to be designed as a tool of assistance." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message0> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk130> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "To ensure an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions performance, The City of Belval's will maintain a response time lower than 2 seconds, with a typical performance benchmark for RAG p95 response time of 1800 ms." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk131> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's availability objective is to achieve 99.92%, exceeding the client's requirement of 99.9%." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk132> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also integrate an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions with existing information systems and user directories using APIs, leveraging identity providers like Keycloak or Active Directory for user authentication and authorization." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk133> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "In terms of regulatory compliance, The City of Belval's confirm that The City of Belval's are generally compliant with GDPR requirements as The City of Belval's only operate within the EU and do not transfer data outside the EU." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk134> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's standard contractual clauses include provisions for data return and destruction upon termination, and The City of Belval's have a no-copyleft GPL contamination policy in place." ;
        prov:wasDerivedFrom <http://example.org/node/message17> .

    <http://example.org/node/chunk135> a prov:Entity ;
        ex:hasText "The City of Belval's will also ensure explicability and transparency of recommendations or proposals issued by an artificial intelligence solution that assists municipal agents in their daily missions, aligning with the requirement that no decision may be automated without explicit validation by an agent." ;
